1
00:00:00,060 --> 00:00:01,878
Kopi pahit pertamamu nggak enak,

2
00:00:01,878 --> 00:00:02,388
kan?

3
00:00:02,388 --> 00:00:04,635
Tapi kenapa sekarang ketagihan?

4
00:00:04,635 --> 00:00:06,553
Kata ilmuwan di jurnal Nature,

5
00:00:06,553 --> 00:00:08,951
yang mengajari otakmu bukan lidah...

6
00:00:08,951 --> 00:00:09,980
tapi perut!

7
00:00:09,980 --> 00:00:11,948
Saat minuman sampai di perut,

8
00:00:11,948 --> 00:00:14,276
otak melepas dopamin pelan-pelan.

9
00:00:14,276 --> 00:00:15,375
Otak belajar:

10
00:00:15,375 --> 00:00:17,303
rasa ini membawa energi,

11
00:00:17,303 --> 00:00:19,540
jadi pahitnya terasa enak.

12
00:00:19,540 --> 00:00:20,559
Anehnya,

13
00:00:20,559 --> 00:00:22,907
sinyal itu lebih kuat di otak kiri.

14
00:00:22,907 --> 00:00:24,126
Peneliti pun...

15
00:00:24,126 --> 00:00:25,425
belum tahu kenapa.

16
00:00:25,425 --> 00:00:28,352
Kamu tim kopi pahit atau kopi manis?

17
00:00:28,352 --> 00:00:29,971
Tulis di komentar!
